## Behaviour recap

| Situation | Result |
|---|---|
| 1–4 projects | 4 cards (or fewer), **no** search input, **no** pager — unchanged layout |
| >4 projects | search input appears; 4 cards + `Showing 4 of 23` + `Load more +4` |
| Click `Load more` | +4 cards, counter updates; last click may add fewer than 4 |
| Filter chip / typing | page resets to 4 (new result set), counter recalculates |
| Open a project → `Projects` (breadcrumb) | page position preserved |
| Summary → "Your projects" | first 4 tiles + same `Load more`, own counter (not affected by the Projects filters) |

Note: `pp.loadMore` / `pp.showing` / `pp.of` were added to **EN and ES** only — the `FR` block deliberately holds no `pp.*`/`sp.*` keys and falls back to EN per key, as it already did for the whole Projects/Sprints vocabulary.

